{"info": {"address1": "B-4, B-5, B-6", "address2": "HAL Industrial Estate HAL GB Quatres Vibhutipura", "city": "Bengaluru", "zip": "560037", "country": "India", "phone": "91 80 6824 3333", "fax": "91 80 6824 3001", "website": "https://group.teamlease.com", "industry": "Staffing & Employment Services", "industryKey": "staffing-employment-services", "industryDisp": "Staffing & Employment Services", "sector": "Industrials", "sectorKey": "industrials", "sectorDisp": "Industrials", "longBusinessSummary": "TeamLease Services Limited engages in human resource services in India and internationally. The company provides temporary and permanent staffing, consulting, IT infrastructure management, offshore development and testing center, information technology, ITES/BPO/call center/KPO/RPO, and medical transcription; IT telecom recruitment, consulting and training, NOC and global NOC, telecom integration and radio frequency, telecom and ISP, marketing/advertising/public relations, and entertainment/ media/journalism; and contractual staffing, payroll support services, HR administrative solutions, banking, financial services, and insurance services. It offers consumer goods and durables/home appliances, consumer products/FMCG, and healthcare/para-medical services; automobile/automotive/ auto components, engineering/procurement and construction, and infrastructure/ utilities; and retail and ecommerce, hospitality, hotels, resorts, restaurants, transportations, agriculture/forestry, dairy/poultry/fishery, and fertilizers/chemicals/paints. In addition, the company provides laptop, desktop, tab, and wi-fi; internet and email software; personal protect equipment, such as gloves, masks, uniforms and shoes, and helmet; desk and cab services; office space, IT/data security, and housekeeping; personal and office sanitization; and BGC and medical check up services. Further, it provides recruitment solutions, including permanent placement and campus hiring; vocational and higher education; online learning and apprenticeships; corporate training; regulatory compliance; HR technology platforms; and infrastructure and asset management services. It serves financial services, consumer, industrial, electronics, telecom, technology, healthcare, agriculture, chemicals, retail, ecommerce, and logistics and transportation industries. TeamLease Services Limited was incorporated in 2000 and is headquartered in Bengaluru, India.", "companyOfficers": [{"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Ashok Kumar Reddy Nedurumalli", "age": 55, "title": "Co-Founder & Executive Vice Chairman", "yearBorn": 1970, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 16600000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Manish Mahendra Sabharwal", "age": 56, "title": "Co-Founder & Non-Executive Non-Independent Director", "yearBorn": 1969, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 13100000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Rituparna  Chakraborty", "age": 50, "title": "Co-Founder & Chief Executive Officer - Degree Apprenticeship", "yearBorn": 1975, "fiscalYear": 2025, "totalPay": 500000, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Ramani  Dathi", "age": 39, "title": "CFO & COO", "yearBorn": 1986, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Alaka  Chanda L.L.B.", "title": "Company Secretary & Compliance Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Ms. Suparna  Mitra", "age": 57, "title": "MD, Director & CEO", "yearBorn": 1968, "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Vamsikrishna  Ithamraju", "title": "Chief Digital & Information Officer", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Navin  Patil", "title": "Head of Human Resources Division", "fiscalYear": 2025, "exercisedValue": 0, "unexercisedValue": 0}, {"maxAge": 1, "name": "Mr. Sudee